                address  : Forum İstanbul 3, Kocatepe  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://www.visitsealife.com/istanbul/en/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Aquarium where you walk through transparent tunnels underwater. It's small compared to Istanbul Aquarium in Yeşilköy, an hour will be plenty, and their combi-tickets with [[Istanbul/Galata#Q110538685 &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#110</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2111">
                    <coordinates>28.8963,41.0456,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
