                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A neighbourhood on the peninsula just south of Kadıköy, Moda features countless neo-classical architectured mansions like the Tubini and churches. The neighbourhood is a favourite place for people of Kadıköy of all ages to take a short stroll on a summer evening, and for the youth to enjoy a few beers against the skyline of the [[Istanbul/Sultanahmet-Old City &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
