                <description>
                category  : See &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Ömerpaşa Cd, Dr. Zeki Zeren Sk 17, Göztepe  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://istanbuloyuncakmuzesi.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Dedicated to toys, this is a museum which adults can enjoy as much as kids. It's founded by poet Sunay Akın, and is housed in a historical mansion in the Göztepe neighbourhood east of Kadıköy. Among the 2,000 pieces of toys from around the world in exhibition, the oldest are a French-made violin from 1817 and a U.S.-made doll from 1820. &lt;br&gt;
