                category  : Do &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The upscale Kalamış neighborhood, which takes its name from the Greek word kalami (καλάμι) meaning reed. Notable places include; Jean Botter Pavilion, Kalamış Park, Fenerbahçe Mosque, Fenerbahçe Park, St. Augustine Catholic Church and St. John Chrysostom Greek Orthodox Church.  &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
