                <description>
                category  : Eat &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Literally the &quot;artists' street&quot;, it hosts selection of pubs (like ''Küff'') and restaurants (mostly meyhanes) plus cultural places like ''Nazım Hikmet Center''. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
