            <Placemark id="2312">
                <name>Caferağa </name>
                <description>
                category  : Drink &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This area is home to dozens if not hundreds of bars, cafes, pubs and restaurants. Some of the most prominent streets are; Karanfil Street (a.k.a. 'bars street'), Moda St., Sarraf Ali St., Sakız Gülü St. and Arayıcıbaşı St. Some bars in this area are interestingly named after animals such as ''Ayı'', ''Fil'' and ''Karga''. Staple clubs like ''Arkaoda'' and ''Dorock XL'' are also in this area. Favorites include ''Bina'', ''Revolte'' and ''Muhit''. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
