            <Placemark id="2382">
                <name>Beşiktaş Market </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy_Bazaars &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : This is where locals go shopping. If you are keen to buy fruits, vegetables, walnuts or olives at local prices, this is where you should head. It is always a good idea to bring rome walnuts or olives back home. Otherwise it is just nice to visit and soak in the atmosphere. This is an authentic market not to be missed. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#166</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2381">
                    <coordinates>29.000517,41.049581,0.0</coordinates>
