                <description>
                category  : Buy &lt;br&gt;
                address  :   &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Smaller than Grand Bazaar, it specialises in herbs and spices. Very touristy, but prices (even after haggling) are twice those in the rest of the city. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
