            <Placemark id="2466">
                <name>Historia AVM </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Adnan Menderes Blv 2  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://www.historia.com.tr/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : AVM (''alışveriş merkezi'') means a shopping mall, and Historia is the only one in the Old City. Usual selections of garments, electronics, furniture, a large supermarket, plus a bowling alley, fast food and a cinema. Across the alley, Fenari İsa Mosque was an early Byzantine church, renovated as a mosque in the 1970s. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
