                url  : https://www.instagram.com/galataportistanbul  &lt;br&gt;
                description  :  It includes the city's cruise ship terminal, around 250 shops, pubs and restaurants, a Peninsula hotel, the Istanbul Modern art museum, and other cultural and entertainment facilities; the complex also hosts festivals. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
