            <Placemark id="2608">
                <name>Bereket Döner </name>
                <description>
                category  : Eat_Budget &lt;br&gt;
                address  : İstiklal Cd, Sadri Alışık Sk 5  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://bereketdoner.com/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A quite good value restaurant featuring ''döner'' (also on the plate as opposed to the usual wrap/sandwich variety; dipped in tomato sauce to the point of swimming) and traditional Turkish cuisine. The restaurant is a self-service one, i.e., you take a tray, and order your food by pointing at the entrance, and pay at the cash register right next to the food display (take your tableware and bread at this point as you won't be served any at the table), and then take your food to a table—there are two more floors upstairs. No alcohol is served. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#82</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2607">
                    <coordinates>28.98075,41.03463,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
