                address  : Müeyyedzade, Necatibey Cd. No:45  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A bit off the tourist track, the stone oven of this börek shop gives its products a distinctive flavour.  Good value and friendly staff.  Opens early, but not all varieties of börek will be ready first thing in the morning—the peynirli böreği is usually amongst the first out of the oven. &lt;br&gt;
