                category  : Eat_Mid-range &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Kallavi Sokağı 13  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.ficcin.com  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The restaurant offers an exceptional value lunch, but is also pleasantly busy at night. Several of the staff speak English and foreign tourists are welcome alongside the many locals who eat there regularly. Fıccın is unusual in being a Circassian restaurant, which also serves Turkish food. Seats are available on the street and in several rooms inside. Alcohol is also served. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
